@*
    The console's footer.

    A partial for the same reason _ConsoleHeader is one: both console pages set Layout = null, so
    without this the one line naming the build would be two lines to keep in step.

    It exists to answer "which version is this?" without a shell on the server. The console is
    served out of the package, so the screen and the assembly are the same release — the number
    here is the one to quote when a behaviour on this page does not match the documentation.
*@
<footer class="ark-console-foot">
    <span>@ViewBag.HostName</span>
    <span class="ark-console-foot-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <a class="ark-powered" href="https://github.com/ir-dev/ark-oauth-oidc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <img src="@ViewBag.ShieldUrl" alt="" width="20" height="20" />
        <span>Powered by <strong>Ark Identity Server</strong></span>
    </a>
    <span class="ark-console-foot-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span>Ark.oAuth.Oidc <code>@ViewBag.PackageVersion</code></span>
</footer>
